# Hypervisor devices: virtio's NIC and disks; the NoCloud ISO, as a SCSI
# CD-ROM, for Lima; and the ACPI power button. Clouds' own devices are in
# cloud.modules. And the root itself: erofs, on a loop device, which stage0
# mounts read-only in every form.
virtio_net virtio_blk sr_mod isofs evdev button erofs loop
